docs {
  # Lists all synthetic monitors in your Dynatrace environment

  **Deprecated**

  Deprecated since version 1.340.x. Please use `api/v2/synthetic/monitors`. The full list can be lengthy, but you can narrow it down by specifying filter query parameters.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:synthetic-monitors:read`

  **API token scopes:** ExternalSyntheticIntegration, DataExport, ReadSyntheticData
}
